1790
01:10:55,018 --> 01:10:56,820
Um-hmm.

1791
01:10:56,853 --> 01:10:58,288
It's woody guthrie.

1792
01:10:58,322 --> 01:11:01,192
Hey, my mood ring's
going all kooky.

1793
01:11:01,225 --> 01:11:03,827
Hmm?

1794
01:11:03,860 --> 01:11:05,328
Adam west?

1795
01:11:05,362 --> 01:11:06,830
Pete dupont?

1796
01:11:06,863 --> 01:11:08,665
That looks like pete.

1797
01:11:12,435 --> 01:11:13,670
Hello, father.

1798
01:11:13,703 --> 01:11:14,872
Hello, mother.

1799
01:11:14,905 --> 01:11:17,140
Uh, here I am in okinawa.

1800
01:11:17,173 --> 01:11:18,375
So you were the one.

1801
01:11:18,408 --> 01:11:19,777
Yes.

1802
